@baseUrl = http://localhost:7000
@accessToken = replace-with-short-lived-keycloak-access-token

### Cloud: explicitly save a fact
POST {{baseUrl}}/advice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Remember: The king has donkey ears!"}

### Cloud or local: recall without model inference or chat history
POST {{baseUrl}}/advice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"What did I ask you to remember?"}

### Missing authentication must return 401 when memory is enabled
POST {{baseUrl}}/advice
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Recall memories"}
